  "title": "R18: CLI wiring \u2014 scorecard --scheduling and --strategies, orchestrator explain <task>, orchestrator promotion, plus README rows",
  "spec": "Why: sched_scorecard, strategy, decision_log and promotion merged as modules with format functions but no command exposes them (orchestrator/cli.py:124-166 scorecard flags, subparsers).\nWhat (orchestrator/cli.py, README.md; Tests: this repo runs unittest; every acceptance test id is a `def test_name(self)` method inside a unittest.TestCase subclass in the named file; no pytest fixtures; use the daemon test harness in tests/_harness.py.): scorecard gains --scheduling (sched_scorecard.build/format) and --strategies (strategy.scorecard/format) as mutually exclusive with the existing flags (extend the existing exclusivity check and error text); new subcommands `explain <task>` (decision_log.explain + format_explain, --json) and `promotion` (promotion.report + format_report, --json); README pipeline table gets one row per new command. Every new command supports --json where the others do.",
